{"screen_name": "testmfos", "file": "testmfos-691ba6", "name": "Test", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013866985600528384/6ZK6hI5I.jpg", "header_url": null, "description": "", "total_works": 8, "scraped_works": 8, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T23:17:24.006123+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T23:17:24.006123+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 3000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T23:17:24.006123+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 3000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 3000, "max": 3000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/Testmfos", "name": "Testmfos"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/87046478", "name": "87046478"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@testmfos/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/467d79da/uploads/origins/8b163e8c-3d82-40ab-881d-ea5211a2e316?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b2052373fd75f295ddbdcd2b9efdcd6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/467d79da/uploads/origins/8b163e8c-3d82-40ab-881d-ea5211a2e316?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b2052373fd75f295ddbdcd2b9efdcd6, https://si.imgix.net/467d79da/uploads/origins/8b163e8c-3d82-40ab-881d-ea5211a2e316?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27d0cffc9e54b71fb61adbd23eb9244e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/467d79da/uploads/origins/8b163e8c-3d82-40ab-881d-ea5211a2e316?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ee014aafcbc9c786997f591eb593519 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！僕のスーパーヒーローOCを、君の「僕のヒーロー」アートスタイルで、マスクをつけずに描いてくれないかな。彼の名前はStarlyterで、光ベースの力を持っています。ありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uLitkeUs1fdC-RghwOLgHnpiSgo8fbp0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/813b3dc0/uploads/origins/04dbb378-728b-49fc-baa6-b75e4246e1f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f3adb0e19491493062d9851f2197955", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/813b3dc0/uploads/origins/04dbb378-728b-49fc-baa6-b75e4246e1f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f3adb0e19491493062d9851f2197955, https://si.imgix.net/813b3dc0/uploads/origins/04dbb378-728b-49fc-baa6-b75e4246e1f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14e37e986bf7d6d610a64937fda81d3c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/813b3dc0/uploads/origins/04dbb378-728b-49fc-baa6-b75e4246e1f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f194ea0f556f44e7b413d44953a1280b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！Twitterにアップロードされてるヒロアカのファンアートに心惹かれ、リクエストをお送りさせて頂きました。もしケモノキャラのリクエストが可能でしたら、以下の私のキャラクターを描いて頂く事は可能でしょうか？\n\n資料は以下となります↓\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/jozot3nnzr8jmrk/%E3%81%93%E3%82%93%E5%90%89%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%BB%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83small.jpg?dl=0\n\n↓隠れている所が分かる参考画\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/8yxui4j0nes5mqf/%E3%81%93%E3%82%93%E5%90%89%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%BB%E5%8F%82%E8%80%832small.jpg?dl=0\n\nかっこよさげな内容で仕上げて頂ければ、残りは（デザイン省略など）描きやすい形でお願いできればと思います。ご無理のない範囲で描いて頂ければ結構です！\n何卒宜しくお願い致します……！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b91b3a35/uploads/origins/bd56b05f-423f-4bf0-9196-f192a18a4324?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a37ddc99ec260c5d5145f9e8ecf56da4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b91b3a35/uploads/origins/bd56b05f-423f-4bf0-9196-f192a18a4324?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a37ddc99ec260c5d5145f9e8ecf56da4, https://si.imgix.net/b91b3a35/uploads/origins/bd56b05f-423f-4bf0-9196-f192a18a4324?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d8430c1b4a1c5b4ea8d99319e35830e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b91b3a35/uploads/origins/bd56b05f-423f-4bf0-9196-f192a18a4324?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c9c65a832f55bba74ca3175ac12bea8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、この度はご応募ありがとうございました。この子は、あなたの好きなように描いてください。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@gengerv3/works/35\nhttps://skeb.jp/@gengerv3/works/36", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e10f480/uploads/origins/aa5400e6-ae1c-4dcc-8b07-265434832066?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21805b99126d03db59a1bd6d70f3ec42", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e10f480/uploads/origins/aa5400e6-ae1c-4dcc-8b07-265434832066?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21805b99126d03db59a1bd6d70f3ec42, https://si.imgix.net/4e10f480/uploads/origins/aa5400e6-ae1c-4dcc-8b07-265434832066?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0228309139c427aaf6a26732c594580b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e10f480/uploads/origins/aa5400e6-ae1c-4dcc-8b07-265434832066?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c243ec3be0577ad3bfbe7ddea6cfc4a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールありがとうございます。私のキツネの女の子、ミズネの絵をお願いしたいのです。気弱な性格だが、その家系は富と地位を失った旧貴族の家系である。水の魔法を受け継いでおり、水を自在に操ることができる。\n\n高貴な血筋を思わせるように、水を優雅に操り、その姿を披露してほしい。ポーズや水の操り方など、細かい部分はお任せします。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/511xQmN", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9523fba8/uploads/origins/9e2c67d1-cf38-4c49-9ff8-d0655ef7efd5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adb0b2e398ce0b6670b5b68b4f2c5def", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9523fba8/uploads/origins/9e2c67d1-cf38-4c49-9ff8-d0655ef7efd5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adb0b2e398ce0b6670b5b68b4f2c5def, https://si.imgix.net/9523fba8/uploads/origins/9e2c67d1-cf38-4c49-9ff8-d0655ef7efd5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c46955f44db439a3b304e0db12e629ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9523fba8/uploads/origins/9e2c67d1-cf38-4c49-9ff8-d0655ef7efd5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=440bcd9bbbb56c02ebe9b8c745b87de4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Howdy!! I received your appeal to draw me and i would be thrilled if you could!\n\nIll let you decide what to do for the art, ill just give a brief description of my VTuber!\n\nHis name is Ace Ayune, he's a magic oracle femboy that's 4'9\" (148 cm), he's very chaotic, mischievous, and sometimes lewd. He loves cute things and can be flustered easily, but can also be aggressive, though he's not very intimidating since he's very short. A lot of his backstory has to do with space, sunsets, and monsters like Cthulhu!\n\nPlease draw him however you’d like, and please include a PNG version of the artwork!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cBAN5pi71M3rhvWiP_L7fTWVyQ2lBo66", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5894628641773bad91e09b11d66d522", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5894628641773bad91e09b11d66d522, https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a205389372fa690d0c7c8dd08435b6d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=540c6cd2170f7bc679fa4b78b47ab1e5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thanks for your request!\nI'd like you to draw my My Hero Academia original character, the half-american, half-japanese heroine in training Loanstar. https://imgur.com/a/iY2VvXO\nShe's a strong country gal that loves the outdoors and wants to be as strong as she can be to protect herself and others.\nA cowgirl through and through, she's a fair bit of a tomboy with her messy hair and competitive nature, but isn't afraid to do girly things she likes.\nHer quirk allows her to grab and siphon mass from things to shrink them, or give mass to other stuff to make it larger, including people, causing her hands to emit a wispy mist.\n\nFeel free to draw her doing whatever you feel appropriate for her!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/66079b0f/uploads/origins/81c287d5-2e86-4c6e-a918-0eda915dd334?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d43652fda884387af4bd3e80a2ec1ff", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66079b0f/uploads/origins/81c287d5-2e86-4c6e-a918-0eda915dd334?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d43652fda884387af4bd3e80a2ec1ff, https://si.imgix.net/66079b0f/uploads/origins/81c287d5-2e86-4c6e-a918-0eda915dd334?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b53a0f24a02f2aa5fb1baf0327cb246 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66079b0f/uploads/origins/81c287d5-2e86-4c6e-a918-0eda915dd334?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88908158b563a61cd08571c52097c359 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "へーきへーき!!!私の牛のOCを描いていただけたら嬉しいです!!!どんなのが出てくるか楽しみです!!!\n\nどんな作品に仕上がるのか楽しみですあなたの絵はとてもかわいいです!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1O2ZlJczTfPokCQjD1PWYAPPfBK0_5xek?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/de8fd07e/uploads/origins/ea52fe80-ef84-47b8-9489-e36efc9a3b05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=557c28107c844d15c26f5941fe5d36d8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de8fd07e/uploads/origins/ea52fe80-ef84-47b8-9489-e36efc9a3b05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=557c28107c844d15c26f5941fe5d36d8, https://si.imgix.net/de8fd07e/uploads/origins/ea52fe80-ef84-47b8-9489-e36efc9a3b05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad0534ce71b92e8514266e9198fa3d06 2x, https://si.imgix.net/de8fd07e/uploads/origins/ea52fe80-ef84-47b8-9489-e36efc9a3b05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af5469acc36982cec046eb1db0b1efac 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエストありがとうございました\n僕のオリジナルキャラクター「僕のヒーローアカデミア」を描いてください。ザラはアメリカで育ち、日本に帰ってきた女の子で、スポーツやアウトドアが好きなため、体格がよく、少し筋肉質です。私のキャラクターは、色白の肌ととても明るいブロンドの髪をしています。サファイアの結晶を作る「Quirk」を持っているため、毛先はサファイアのような濃い青色をしています。反抗的な態度で、運動性の高い動きやすい服を好んで着ている。\n\nこれらの写真は、私のキャラクターがどのように見えるかの参考のためです。\nhttps://imgur.com/Jdvj0y0\nhttps://imgur.com/PJYAhb5\n\nもしご迷惑でなければ、テキストを別レイヤーに置いていただけないでしょうか？ありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}